    "## Part II\n",
    "\n",
    "Write code to solve the dynamical system, and answer the following\n",
    "questions:\n",
    "\n",
    "c.  Suppose $r=0.1$ and $K=0.6$. Generate time series of the populations\n",
    "    for a few starting populations $x(1)$. Does it match your intuition?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "cell-5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
